SlotSpec planned
---
bool success
string message
geometry_msgs/Pose actual_pose
float64 xy_error
float64 z_error
float64 yaw_error
float64 roll
float64 pitch
float64 drift
int32 point_count
# Extents measured from the placed box's top face. Closes the loop on the
# pickup-time size estimate: a disagreement means the committed footprint is
# wrong, which is what would let the next box be planned into this one.
float64 measured_width
float64 measured_depth
float64 measured_height
